    "description": "BO KIEM THU CHUAN NOP BAI - BAI KIEM TRA SO 2 (TX2) - HE THONG PITCHOS\nVung so huu: Nhat (pitchos-booking-service + postman/collection.json)\n\nTHU TU CHAY:\n  1. Thu muc '1. Authentication & RBAC'  -> sinh 3 Bearer Token luu vao bien collection.\n  2. Thu muc '2. Integration & Error Handling (IT01-IT07)' -> bo test tich hop Consumer/Provider.\n     Rieng IT03b, IT04, IT05 can thao tac Docker ghi trong phan Description cua tung request.\n  3. Thu muc '3. Service Discovery & Load Balancing (TC01-TC06)' -> danh ba Eureka va can bang tai.\n     TC03 chay bang Collection Runner voi Iterations = 20.\n\nYEU CAU TRUOC KHI CHAY: docker compose up -d va toan bo container o trang thai healthy.",
